Braun (Hopelessly Honest Inventor)
==================================

*"I know that I'm not all that strong or brave... but I'll protect her with everything I've got!"*

*A reclusive inventor who unexpectedly gained a robotic companion, and a reason to be braver.*

**Background**

A brilliant but socially awkward inventor, Braun lived alone
surrounded by half-finished gadgets, always chasing the one
breakthrough that would make his mark. That breakthrough turned
out to be Miho, a damaged android he found discarded and repaired
-- who has stayed loyally by his side ever since, upending his
quiet, solitary life.

**Personality**

Introverted and easily flustered, especially around women, Braun
is nonetheless kind and honest to a fault -- a terrible liar who
wears his feelings openly. He can be absent-minded, and is an
easy target for bullies.

